---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { destinations, photo } from '../../data/travel';

const reason = Astro.url.searchParams.get('reason') ?? '';
const selectedTrip = destinations.find((trip) => trip.slug === reason);
const initialMessage = selectedTrip ? `I'm interested in the ${selectedTrip.name} journey.` : reason === 'custom' ? 'I have an idea for a custom journey.' : '';
---
<PageLayout title="Contact | Plan a trip with Wanderwell" description="Tell our trip designers what you are dreaming about. We’ll help you shape a thoughtful journey.">
	<main class="inner-page">
		<section class="page-hero"><div class="page-hero-image" style={`background-image:url('${photo('photo-1470252649378-9c29740c9fa8', 1800)}')`}></div><div class="page-hero-content"><span class="page-eyebrow">A REAL PERSON IS ON THE OTHER END</span><h1>Let’s talk<br /><em>about somewhere.</em></h1><p>Share a few details and a trip designer will get back to you within two working days.</p></div></section>
		<section class="content-wrap">
			<div class="contact-grid"><aside class="contact-info"><span class="eyebrow">START WITH A HELLO</span><h2>Tell us what’s on your mind.</h2><p>You don’t need a finished plan. A place you’re curious about, the kind of days you love, or the dates you have in mind are plenty to get us started.</p><div class="contact-details"><span>✉ &nbsp; hello@wanderwell.travel</span><span>◷ &nbsp; Monday to Friday, 9am–5pm</span><span>↗ &nbsp; Based everywhere our partners call home</span></div></aside>
				<form class="contact-form" id="contact-form">
					<label>Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required placeholder="How should we call you?" /></label>
					<label>Email address<input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="you@example.com" /></label>
					<label>Where are you dreaming of?<select name="destination"><option value="">I’m still deciding</option>{destinations.map((trip) => <option selected={selectedTrip?.slug === trip.slug}>{trip.name}</option>)}<option>Somewhere else</option></select></label>
					<label>When might you travel?<input type="month" name="month" /></label>
					<label class="full">A little about your trip<textarea name="message" required placeholder="Who’s travelling? What would a great trip feel like to you?">{initialMessage}</textarea></label>
					<button class="primary-button" type="submit">Open your email app <span>↗</span></button><p class="form-status" id="form-status" role="status">This will open an email draft addressed to our trip team. Nothing is sent until you choose to send it.</p>
				</form>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section class="content-wrap" style="padding-top:0"><div class="content-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">A FEW QUICK ANSWERS</span><h2>Before you ask.</h2></div></div><div class="faq-list"><details class="faq-item"><summary>How does trip planning work?</summary><p>We start with a conversation about your dates, interests, and pace. A trip designer then suggests a route and stays, and we refine it together before you decide to book.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>Are the trips private or group journeys?</summary><p>Most of our journeys can be arranged privately for your party. A few departures are small-group trips. We’ll make the format clear in your itinerary proposal.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>How much does a trip cost?</summary><p>Each journey page shows a guide price per person. Your final proposal depends on dates, room choices, and the experiences you’d like included.</p></details></div></section>
	</main>
	<script>
		const form = document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#contact-form');
		form?.addEventListener('submit', (event) => {
			event.preventDefault();
			const values = new FormData(form);
			const subject = `Wanderwell trip enquiry — ${values.get('name')}`;
			const body = `Name: ${values.get('name')}\nEmail: ${values.get('email')}\nDestination: ${values.get('destination') || 'Undecided'}\nTravel month: ${values.get('month') || 'Not set'}\n\n${values.get('message')}`;
			window.location.href = `mailto:hello@wanderwell.travel?subject=${encodeURIComponent(subject)}&body=${encodeURIComponent(body)}`;
		});
	</script>
</PageLayout>
